# Email OTP delivery
#
# Local development can omit these values and use the default console backend.
# Staging/production can use SMTP by setting the variables below.
#
# Gmail SMTP notes:
# - Gmail requires an App Password.
# - A normal Gmail account password will not work.
# - App Passwords require 2-Step Verification enabled in the Google account.

